<title>GERMANY: HOCKEY-WOMEN'S CHAMPIONS' TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-WOMEN'S CHAMPIONS' TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the second day of the</p>
<p>Champions' Trophy women's hockey tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>South Korea beat Britain 2-0 (halftime 0-0).</p>
<p>Scorers: Choi Eun-kyung 60, Lee Ji-young 68.</p>
<p>Germany 2 United States 2 (halftime 1-0).</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Germany: Inga Moller 17, Natascha Keller 39.</p>
<p>United States: Tara Maguire 47, Kelly James 61.  </p>
<p> Australia  2  Netherlands   0  (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Alyson Annan 34, Jennifer Morris 50.</p>
</text>
